.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-27T13:36:38-07:00","id":1097609,"title":"","content":"I don't know if this counts as a valid point for Errata, but I've yet to see the Primordial Dream chapter mention the bit in the Beast core (pg. 100) where it says that Beasts can cut their Lairs off from the larger Hive to protect themselves from the Hive Trait created by an Apex. It's not mentioned at all. Was it just forgotten while writing this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-28T21:38:48-07:00","id":1097977,"title":"","content":"p. 5: &quot;Listen to the Mustn'ts&quot; shouldn't be in italics<br /> p. 7: There's an extraneous space before the leading quotation mark in the chapter quote<br /> p. 7: &quot;Building <b>A </b>Legend is not meant...&quot; -- should be lowercase<br /> p. 8: &quot;...or <b>the </b>Bristol from Werewolf...&quot;<br /> p. 11: &quot;<i>Metropolis <b>II</b>: Scenes from <b>A </b>Memory</i>&quot; - The title is more properly <i>Metropolis Pt. 2: Scenes from a Memory</i><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T13:22:49-07:00","id":1098862,"title":"","content":"Page 35 - - under Invading Heroes and Horrors says... &quot;Many Heroes have ways of entering a Beast\u2019s Lair \u2014 and not just the Lair of the Beast that made them what they are.&quot; <br /> <br /> Where Beasts causing Heroes isn't in place anymore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T18:50:50-07:00","id":1098964,"title":"","content":"p. 17 &quot;I don\u2019t know if I more than half believe he was real.&quot;<br /> <br /> Awkward wording. I don't have an easy suggestion on what to use instead. Maybe &quot;I don't even know if I believe he was real&quot; or &quot;Even I don't believe he was real&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 05-31-2017, 09:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-01T11:17:19-07:00","id":1099220,"title":"","content":"p. 19 &quot;Hunter: The Vigil has a similar system for building monsters that the group.&quot; <br /> <br /> Incomplete sentence. Probably finish it with something like &quot;Hunter: The Vigil has a similar system for building monsters that the group <i><b>could fight</b></i>.&quot; Or &quot;Hunter: The Vigil has a similar system for building monsters that the group <i><b>could use</b></i>.&quot; Or if you feel so inclined, drop the second half of the sentence to be &quot;Hunter: The Vigil has a similar system for building monsters.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-04T23:35:36-07:00","id":1100352,"title":"","content":"p. 35 &quot;...can actually be an advantage even if they affect the Beast, in fact. Most Hive Traits can cramp the Beast\u2019s style at least occasionally, however, and some Major Traits can render what the Children normally consider a safe place dangerous even to them.&quot;<br /> <br /> The &quot;in fact&quot;'s placement doesn't make sense for that sentence. Either drop it entirely or shift it to the other sentences. &quot;...can actually be an advantage even if they affect the Beast. <i><b>In fact, most Hive Traits can cramp the Beast\u2019s style, at least occasionally.</b></i> <i><b>However some Major Traits</b></i> can render what the Children normally consider a safe place dangerous even to them.&quot;<br /> <br /> p. 37 &quot;...must face an enemy that requires them to work together just to survive he encounter.&quot;<br /> <br /> Missing a &quot;t&quot; for &quot;the&quot;. Should read &quot;...must face an enemy that requires them to work together just to survive <i><b>the</b></i> encounter.&quot;<br /> <br /> p. 40 &quot;Some questions about the effects of supernatural creatures and events on the region:&quot;<br /> <br /> The second half of the sentence (&quot;...creatures and events on the region&quot;) has off-center spacing.<br /> <br /> p.41 &quot;Finally, some questions about any Unfettered that might haunt the region. If multiple Unfettered lurk in the area, these questions could apply to any of them:&quot;<br /> <br /> First part of the sentence (&quot;Finally, some questions about any Unfettered...&quot;) is indented too far to the left, inconsistent with previous paragraphs in the &quot;Assembling the Primordial Dream&quot; section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 06-05-2017, 03:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}